# Jar to NFWC (Forge primary verify)

After any **Forge 1.19.2** playable change that needs in-game verify, **ALWAYS**:

1. **Build** — `cd forge/1.19.2` then `.\gradlew.bat jar` (or project convention).
2. **Dist** — copy `build/libs/packai-<mod_version>.jar` to both:
   - `dist/packai-<mod_version>+mc1.19.2-forge.jar`
   - `dist/packai-1.19.2-forge.jar` (stable alias)
   Read `mod_version` from `forge/1.19.2/gradle.properties` (do not invent; do not bump unless releasing).
3. **NFWC mods** — copy that jar into:
   `C:\Users\skps9\Documents\PrismLauncher-Windows-MSVC-Portable-8.0\PrismLauncher-Windows-MSVC-Portable-8.0\instances\AI_test_NFWC_DIM\minecraft\mods\`
   Prefer versioned name `packai-<mod_version>+mc1.19.2-forge.jar`. **Remove/replace** older `packai*.jar` in that folder so only **one** Pack AI jar remains.

## NeoForge / ATM10

User primary test path is **NFWC Forge**. Copy Neo jar into ATM10 (or other Neo instance) **only when Neo tree was touched**; optional otherwise.

## Keybind

NFWC / Prism play: Pack AI open keybind is **`;`** (not `]` — `]` is often runClient / default docs).
